    "sub_name": "城市科技與感測應用專論",
    "sub_ename": "SMART CITY TECHNOLOGY AND IOT APPLICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本項課程將各種感測應用的原理、感測資訊的接收、資料的分析整合，應用在城市的管理，將IoT技術應用在城市營運的各種面向，以達到智慧應用及管理之目的",
    "describe_eh": "This lecture integrates and applies the theories of different sensing applications, reception of sensing information and information analysis into the city management. Through the implementations of IoT technologies in various faces of city management, smart application and management can be achieved.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
